{
  "notes": {
    "purpose": "Board-scoped task edits PR 1 (docs/BOARD_SCOPED_TASK_EDITS.md §2–§4, §6–§7): deterministic fork ids + planBoardScopedFork. Shared by packages/shared/tests/algorithms/boardScopedFork.test.ts and apps/ios/OYBCTests/BoardScopedForkVectorTests.swift (byte-identical copy in apps/ios/OYBCTests/Fixtures).",
    "ids": "forkTaskId(boardId, taskId) = uuidv5(\"fork:task:<boardId>:<taskId>\"); forkedEventId(forkId, eventId) = uuidv5(\"fork:event:<forkId>:<eventId>\"); forkLinkId(forkId, childTaskId) = uuidv5(\"fork:link:<forkId>:<childTaskId>\") — all under OYBC_NAMESPACE. Literals below pin both platforms.",
    "tasks": "Each vector task is expanded by the harness with lifetime caches that a fork must reset: isCompleted true, completedAt set, currentCount 5 (counting only), totalCompletions 3, totalInstances 2, version 7, createdAt/updatedAt 2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z, isCounter true.",
    "events": "Each event is expanded with userId \"u1\", version 3, createdAt/updatedAt 2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z, isDeleted false unless set.",
    "fork": "Every fork must have id=forkId, forkedFromTaskId=task.id, createdInWizard true, isCounter false, version 1, createdAt=updatedAt=now, isDeleted false, isCompleted false, no completedAt, currentCount 0 for counting (absent otherwise), totalCompletions 0, totalInstances 1, title/type unchanged. Every event copy: taskId=forkId, createdAt=updatedAt=now, version 1, userId preserved, isDeleted false. Every link copy: compoundTaskId=forkId, version 1, createdAt=updatedAt=now, isDeleted false.",
    "windows": "Window = [startDate, min(endDate, sealedAt)], inclusive both ends, parsed-instant compare; endDate null = open-ended. All instants are Z-suffixed so the vectors are timezone-independent."
  },
